<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>Note:&#x000D;&#x000A;The calibration reference waveform consists of the trigger header and 16 sine waveforms. &#x000D;&#x000A;The frequencies of 16 sine waveforms are defined as variable &quot;freqvec(9:24)&#x201C; in the equation of this subnet, which covers the frequency range from 270MHz to 370MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;If above picture can&apos;t be loaded in this schematic, please find and view &quot;multi-channel_cali_waveform.png&quot; in the same directory as this example workspace.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
